{"t":"Fury Dungeon","s":"fury-dungeon-99e62","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Fury_0f8d09.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Warning Icon Red\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warning_Icon_Red_1eeb32.png\" width=\"50\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">This article or section is about an event NPC, creature, item, object, outfit or location.</p><br/><p>The information about this NPC, <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creature</a>, item, object, outfit or location is only relevant during a certain event or quest, e.g. only during Christmas.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Do not remove the information on this page because you can't find the NPC/creature/item/object/outfit/location.</p><p style=\"line-height:6pt;font-size:6pt;width:100%;text-align:right;\">discuss</p></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Fury Dungeon</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Fury\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fury_0f8d09.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Accessed via a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fury%20Gate\">Fury Gate</a> that can appear outside most cities as part of the <a href=\"#/quest/fury-gates-mini-world-change\">Fury Gates Mini World Change</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.10<br/>July 17, 2013<br/>Summer Update 2013 Part 1</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fury Dungeon</strong>, located deep below <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33303,31829,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33303, 31829, 14)</a>, can only be accessed through a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fury%20Gate\">Fury Gate</a> as part of the <a href=\"#/quest/fury-gates-mini-world-change\">Fury Gates Mini World Change</a>. This gate appears close to the Tibian towns and like any other Mini World Change, they appear randomly. Only promoted players of level 60 or more may enter it, and from Update 10.56 on, you also need to be premium. This hunting place was implemented in Summer Update 2013 - I, and used to serve as a way to give free account players a taste of usually just premium account <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creatures</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fury Dungeon NPCs (1 NPC)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Falonzo\">Falonzo</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Falonzo\"><img alt=\"Falonzo\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Falonzo_a1eee9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Scientist</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fury Dungeon</strong>, deep below <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Normal_Creatures\">Normal Creatures</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Fire%20Elemental\"><img alt=\"Massive Fire Elemental\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Massive_Fire_Elemental_b9dfee.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Fire%20Elemental\">Massive Fire Elemental</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,400</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,800</td><td 